      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "д) $\\begin{cases}2x=11-3y,\\\\↵3y=11-2x;\\end{cases}$　　е) $\\begin{cases}4x-3y=7,\\\\5x+2y=26.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "453",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "利用图象说明为什么下列方程组有解，而且是唯一解：",
        "$\\begin{cases}3x+0y=15,\\\\↵x+y=7.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "454",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "已知方程 $5x-y=2$。自己写一个方程，使得它和已知",
        "方程组成的方程组满足下列条件：",
        "а) 有一个而且仅有一个解；",
        "б) 无解；",
        "в) 有无限多个解。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "455",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "直线 $3x-7y=1$ 是否经过下面两条直线的交点？",
        "а) $x+0y=-2$ 和 $5x-y=-9$；",
        "б) $0x+y=5$ 和 $x+y=11$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "456",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "利用图象说明三个二元方程组成的方程组有没有解：",
        "а) $\\begin{cases}x+y=2,\\\\↵2x+3y=0,\\\\↵x-y=10;\\end{cases}$　　б) $\\begin{cases}x-y=1,\\\\x+2y=13,\\\\2x-y=3.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "457",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "下列方程组有没有解？",
        "$\\begin{cases}0x+0y=1,\\\\↵x+y=2.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "458",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "方程组",
        "$\\begin{cases}0x+0y=0,\\\\↵x-y=10\\end{cases}$",
        "有多少个解？求出这个方程组的两个解。"
      ]
    },
